* {{audio|En-us-hoard.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|whored|horde}}
* {{rhymes|ɔː(r)d|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[hidden]] [[supply]] or [[fund]].
#: ''a '''hoard''' of provisions; a '''hoard''' of money''
# {{context|archaeology|lang=en}} A [[cache]] of [[valuable]] objects or [[artefact]]s; a [[trove]].
# {{misspelling of|horde|lang=en}}

